# All .claude/skills are user-local by default; the project-wide okx-mcp-release
# skill is the explicit exception so the team shares it via git. Note: a plain
# `.claude/skills/` rule cannot be undone by `!` (git ignores files inside an
# excluded *directory*), hence `.claude/skills/*` + per-entry inversion.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/okx-mcp-release/
aTempFiles/
*.tgz
